      "content": "but what's the point of being proud of it? it just feels like i'm punishing myself for no reason. the \"fight\" is just more pain. i look at people who actually have their lives together and then i look at me. it's just a heavy, miserable way to live. sometimes i wonder if there's even a version of me that isn't just... breaking over and over.",
