    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so bleak when you put it like that. \"that's all you are.\" it feels like there's no actual progress, just different ways to suffer. if the breaking is the only thing that's real... then maybe the only way to actually stop the cycle is to just stop everything. to just find a way to make the noise and the pain finally go quiet.",
